OL,3,ASouth African airline defends
OL,4,Alow-altitude aerial stunt over packed
OL,5,Astadium
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe South African airline behind a
OL,8,Fdramatic stunt that saw two of its
OL,9,Faircraft in close formation fly
OL,10,Freportedly within feet of the top of a
OL,11,Fstadium has defended itself in the face
OL,12,Fof some criticism.
OL,14,FThe jets roared over Cape Town's DHL
OL,15,Fstadium as flares shot up before the
OL,16,Fstart of a rugby match featuring fierce
OL,17,Frivals South Africa and New Zealand.
OL,19,FSome labelled the manoeuvre reckless,
OL,20,Fwhile others have praised the precision
OL,21,Fand expertise required to pull it off.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
